      "title": "Dorchester Minerals, L.P. Announces Agreement to Acquire Mineral and Royalty Interests",
      "summary": "Dorchester Minerals, L.P. announced on October 19, 2026, that it has entered into an agreement to acquire approximately 4,300 net royalty acres of mineral and royalty interests located in three counties across the Williston Basin in North Dakota. The Partnership will issue 1,250,000 common units in exchange for these interests, with the acquisition expected to close on October 30, 2026.",
